<section class="phero"><div class="wrap"><p class="kicker">Support</p><h1 class="t1 rise">Here to help.</h1><p class="lede fade">Client support, answers about our work, and help for people who use NEVORA.</p></div></section><section class="support" aria-labelledby="sup-t"><div class="wrap"><p class="hkick">Client support</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="sup-t">For our clients.</h2><dl class="spec big"><div><dt>Email</dt><dd><a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a><small>We aim to reply within two business days</small></dd></div><div><dt>Phone</dt><dd><a href="tel:+17879252000">787-925-2000</a><small>Monday to Friday, 8 am to 9 pm ET</small></dd></div><div><dt>Postal address</dt><dd>VELANI LLC<small>1654 Calle Tulipan, Suite 100, San&nbsp;Juan, PR&nbsp;00927</small></dd></div></dl><div class="acts"><a class="pill" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/contact{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-contact{% endif %}">Contact page</a></div></div></section><section class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-t"><div class="wrap"><div class="qa"><div class="head"><p class="hkick">Questions</p><h2 class="t2 rise" id="faq-t">Before we start</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>How does my business get NEVORA?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>NEVORA is offered to businesses by quote, with a free 30-day trial for teams of up to 30 employees. After the trial there is one price per business, quoted for your number of employees, your business and the features you use. Ask for a quote or request a trial and we will discuss your team’s needs. Employees get their account from their workplace, not from this website.</p></details><details><summary>Does Velani build custom software?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Yes. Describe the application, internal workflow or integration you need on the contact page.</p></details><details><summary>Can you give me a price or delivery date here?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Not on the website. We price a project once we agree its scope, and we put fees, milestones and delivery dates in the written project agreement.</p></details><details><summary>Does an inquiry start a contract?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>No. An inquiry starts a conversation. It does not purchase a product or begin paid work.</p></details><details><summary>Where should I send sensitive information?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Do not send passwords, API keys, payment details or sensitive records through a public form or ordinary email. Ask for an appropriate channel first.</p></details><details><summary>How do I reach client support?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>Client support answers Monday to Friday, 8 am to 9 pm ET. Write to <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>, call <a href="tel:+17879252000">787-925-2000</a>, or use the contact page.</p></details><details><summary>How does the free NEVORA trial work?<svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M224,128a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H136v80a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V136H40a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h80V40a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v80h80A8,8,0,0,1,224,128Z"/></svg></summary><p>A business with up to 30 employees can use NEVORA free for 30 days from setup. No card is needed and nothing is charged. On day 30 you continue by quote or close the workplace. Export your data first: a closed workplace and its data are deleted within 3 days, timecards and pay statements included. To close it, email <a href="mailto:support@thevelani.com">support@thevelani.com</a>. NEVORA calculates pay statements; it does not pay employees or file payroll taxes.</p></details><div class="acts"><a class="more" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora#faq{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora#faq{% endif %}"><span>NEVORA questions</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="band help" aria-labelledby="help-t"><div class="wrap band-in"><h2 class="t3" id="help-t">Do you use NEVORA at work?</h2><p class="band-links"><a class="more" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-support{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-support{% endif %}"><span>NEVORA support</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a><a class="more" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-privacy{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-privacy{% endif %}"><span>NEVORA privacy policy</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a><a class="more" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-account-deletion{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-account-deletion{% endif %}"><span>Delete your NEVORA account</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a><a class="more" href="{% if theme.role == 'main' %}/pages/nevora-terms{% else %}{{ routes.root_url }}?preview_theme_id={{ theme.id }}&amp;view=velani-nevora-terms{% endif %}"><span>NEVORA terms of use</span><svg class="icon" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256" fill="currentColor"><path d="M181.66,133.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L164.69,128,90.34,53.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32l80,80A8,8,0,0,1,181.66,133.66Z"/></svg></a></p></div></section><section class="hpanel end" id="velani" aria-label="Velani"><img class="hph flip" src="{{ 'night-ai-light.webp' | asset_url }}" alt="" width="1920" height="1080" loading="lazy"><div class